# Core gameplay, local ML demonstrations, pipeline simulation and professional
# content require no runtime secrets. Deployment credentials belong in the
# hosting/CLI credential store, never here.

# Optional during local/CI/preview work; required before an indexable launch.
# Set only after confirming the actual production HTTPS domain and its routing.
# An empty value builds successfully with noindex, no canonical and no sitemap entries.
# Use an origin only: https://your-confirmed-domain.example (no path/query/credentials).
SITE_ORIGIN=

# VERCEL_URL, VERCEL_ENV and VERCEL_TARGET_ENV are host-provided system variables.
# Do not add secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_. See docs/SEO_CONFIGURATION.md.
